      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] Please add unit tests covering `ap_sku_id_restore_state()` to verify this fix and prevent regressions.\n\nAlthough the commit message lists `TEST\u003d./twister -T zephyr/test/drivers -s drivers.system`, the `drivers.system` suite only builds `src/system_not_board_ap_set_sku_id.c` (`!CONFIG_HOSTCMD_AP_SET_SKUID`) and does not currently enable `CONFIG_HOSTCMD_AP_SET_SKUID` or exercise `ap_sku_id_preserve_state()` / `ap_sku_id_restore_state()`.\n\nSpecifically, please add a test target/file in `zephyr/test/drivers/system` (with `CONFIG_HOSTCMD_AP_SET_SKUID` enabled) that verifies:\n1. **Happy path (preserve and restore):** Setting the SKU ID via `EC_CMD_SET_SKU_ID`, preserving state (`hook_notify(HOOK_SYSJUMP)`), resetting the in-memory `ap_sku_id`, and restoring state (`hook_notify(HOOK_INIT)`) restores `system_get_sku_id()` to the preserved value on 64-bit POSIX builds.\n2. **Missing jump tag (`prev_ap_sku_id \u003d\u003d NULL`):** Running `hook_notify(HOOK_INIT)` when no `AP_SKUID_SYSJUMP_TAG` tag is present leaves `ap_sku_id` unchanged.\n3. **Version mismatch (`version !\u003d AP_SKUID_HOOK_VERSION`):** Adding an `AP_SKUID_SYSJUMP_TAG` tag with `version \u003d AP_SKUID_HOOK_VERSION - 1` or `AP_SKUID_HOOK_VERSION + 1` and `size \u003d sizeof(uint32_t)` does not overwrite `ap_sku_id` on `hook_notify(HOOK_INIT)`.\n4. **Size mismatch boundaries (`size !\u003d sizeof(ap_sku_id)`):** Adding an `AP_SKUID_SYSJUMP_TAG` tag with `version \u003d AP_SKUID_HOOK_VERSION` and adjacent invalid sizes (`sizeof(uint32_t) - 1`, `sizeof(uint32_t) + 1`, or `sizeof(const uint32_t *)` on 64-bit) does not overwrite `ap_sku_id` on `hook_notify(HOOK_INIT)`.\n\nFor example:\n```c\n#define AP_SKUID_SYSJUMP_TAG 0x4153 /* AS */\n#define AP_SKUID_HOOK_VERSION 1\n\nstatic void prepare_jump_data(void)\n{\n\tstruct jump_data *jdata \u003d get_jump_data();\n\n\tsystem_common_pre_init();\n\tjdata-\u003emagic \u003d JUMP_DATA_MAGIC;\n\tjdata-\u003eversion \u003d JUMP_DATA_VERSION;\n\tjdata-\u003ejump_tag_total \u003d 0;\n\tjdata-\u003estruct_size \u003d sizeof(struct jump_data);\n}\n\nZTEST(system, test_ap_sku_id_preserve_and_restore)\n{\n\tstruct ec_params_set_sku_id set_sku \u003d { .sku_id \u003d 0x12345678 };\n\tstruct ec_params_set_sku_id clear_sku \u003d { .sku_id \u003d 0 };\n\n\tprepare_jump_data();\n\tzassert_ok(ec_cmd_set_sku_id(NULL, \u0026set_sku));\n\tzassert_equal(system_get_sku_id(), 0x12345678);\n\n\thook_notify(HOOK_SYSJUMP);\n\n\t/* Overwrite in-memory SKU ID before restoring from jump tag. */\n\tzassert_ok(ec_cmd_set_sku_id(NULL, \u0026clear_sku));\n\tzassert_equal(system_get_sku_id(), 0);\n\n\thook_notify(HOOK_INIT);\n\tzassert_equal(system_get_sku_id(), 0x12345678);\n}\n\nZTEST(system, test_ap_sku_id_restore_invalid_tag_conditions)\n{\n\tconst uint64_t bad_payload \u003d 0xdeadbeefdeadbeefULL;\n\tstruct ec_params_set_sku_id init_sku \u003d { .sku_id \u003d 0xabcdef01 };\n\n\t/* 1. Missing tag (prev_ap_sku_id \u003d\u003d NULL) */\n\tprepare_jump_data();\n\tzassert_ok(ec_cmd_set_sku_id(NULL, \u0026init_sku));\n\thook_notify(HOOK_INIT);\n\tzassert_equal(system_get_sku_id(), 0xabcdef01);\n\n\t/* 2. Version mismatch (AP_SKUID_HOOK_VERSION - 1 and + 1) */\n\tprepare_jump_data();\n\tzassert_ok(system_add_jump_tag(AP_SKUID_SYSJUMP_TAG,\n\t\t\t\t       AP_SKUID_HOOK_VERSION - 1,\n\t\t\t\t       sizeof(uint32_t), \u0026bad_payload));\n\thook_notify(HOOK_INIT);\n\tzassert_equal(system_get_sku_id(), 0xabcdef01);\n\n\tprepare_jump_data();\n\tzassert_ok(system_add_jump_tag(AP_SKUID_SYSJUMP_TAG,\n\t\t\t\t       AP_SKUID_HOOK_VERSION + 1,\n\t\t\t\t       sizeof(uint32_t), \u0026bad_payload));\n\thook_notify(HOOK_INIT);\n\tzassert_equal(system_get_sku_id(), 0xabcdef01);\n\n\t/* 3. Size mismatch boundaries (sizeof(uint32_t) - 1 and + 1) */\n\tprepare_jump_data();\n\tzassert_ok(system_add_jump_tag(AP_SKUID_SYSJUMP_TAG,\n\t\t\t\t       AP_SKUID_HOOK_VERSION,\n\t\t\t\t       sizeof(uint32_t) - 1, \u0026bad_payload));\n\thook_notify(HOOK_INIT);\n\tzassert_equal(system_get_sku_id(), 0xabcdef01);\n\n\tprepare_jump_data();\n\tzassert_ok(system_add_jump_tag(AP_SKUID_SYSJUMP_TAG,\n\t\t\t\t       AP_SKUID_HOOK_VERSION,\n\t\t\t\t       sizeof(uint32_t) + 1, \u0026bad_payload));\n\thook_notify(HOOK_INIT);\n\tzassert_equal(system_get_sku_id(), 0xabcdef01);\n}\n```\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/f9f74a07-936d-4f97-adba-425d7d5c05bf)",
